{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119636","id":3725091027,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7eCGDT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119636","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119636.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119636.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119636","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119636/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119636/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119636/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bfb68740d464cdce3aec57181fb8d0adff3e6d73","number":119636,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix path navigation, stale file cleanup, and dead code in SCU builder script","user":{"login":"notthecloudy","id":159792933,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYY_JQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159792933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy","html_url":"https://github.com/notthecloudy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notthecloudy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fix path navigation, stale file cleanup, and dead code in SCU builder script\r\n\r\n- Cache and restore the original working directory during folder file discovery to prevent breaking sub-folder iterations.\r\n- Convert stale file strings to Path objects to fix membership checks against fresh_files, preventing stale compilation units from lingering.\r\n- Remove redundant unreachable return statement following a raised RuntimeError.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR addresses three distinct stability and quality issues in the `scu_builders.py` generation tool script:\r\n\r\n1. **Broken Directory Traversal:** In `find_files_in_folder`, the script called `os.chdir(abs_folder)` to scan directory paths but never restored the previous state. Because this mutated the global working directory during runtime, subsequent recursive steps or loop iterations over unrelated subfolders would fail silently or look into incorrect, nested directory configurations. Caching and restoring the path via `os.getcwd()` ensures stability across directory iterations.\r\n2. **Broken Stale File Deletion:** In `clear_out_stale_files`, the script checked raw file string iterations against `fresh_files`. However, `fresh_files` is tracked exclusively as a set of `Path` objects. This mismatched type evaluation caused `file not in fresh_files` to always evaluate to `True`, meaning old or modified compilation units were failing membership checks and could linger undetected in the `.scu/` directories. Casting these strings to `Path` objects enforces correct membership tracking.\r\n3. **Dead Code Cleanup:** Cleans up an unreachable `return` statement placed immediately after an explicitly raised `RuntimeError` at the top of `generate_scu_files`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- **Code areas updated:** `methods/scu_builders.py` (or the equivalent location of your SCU builder script).\r\n- These logic updates reduce compilation anomalies caused by lingering `.gen.cpp` modules when alternating between unique build profiles or source file adjustments.\r\n- **AI Disclosure:** There was no use of AI in this commit.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-21T17:04:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T16:37:54Z","closed_at":"2026-08-19T16:34:31Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ac291b3d0900a0e3bbd43ae31d81d27f3dd21dce","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"notthecloudy:patch-1","ref":"patch-1","repo":null,"sha":"bfb68740d464cdce3aec57181fb8d0adff3e6d73","user":{"login":"notthecloudy","id":159792933,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYY_JQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser